e ecosystem, fine-tuning LLMs (e.g., Llama), and implement advanced prompt engineering techniques using frameworks like LangChain.'}, {'step': 5, 'title': 'Vector Databases and RAG', 'description': 'Implement Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems. Learn to use Vector Databases (e.g., ChromaDB, Pinecone) to manage embeddings for semantic search and generation.'}, {'step': 6, 'title': 'MLOps and Deployment', 'description': 'Learn how to deploy ML models using tools like Docker and AWS SageMaker/GCP AI Platform. Focus on model monitoring and version control.'}], 'suggested_projects': [{'title': 'Advanced NLP Chatbot with RAG', 'description': 'Develop an advanced chatbot application using a Large Language Model (via OpenAI or open source) integrated with a Vector Database (ChromaDB/Pinecone) to enable Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG). Focus on embedding generation, semantic search, and context-aware response generation.', 'technologies': ['Python', 'LangChain', 'LLMs (OpenAI/HuggingFace)', 'Vector Databases (ChromaDB)', 'Embeddings']}, {'title': 'Computer Vision Model for Object Detection', 'description': 'Build and train a Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) model using PyTorch or TensorFlow to perform real-time object detection or image classification on custom datasets. Focus on data augmentation, model training, and deployment.', 'technologies': ['PyTorch / TensorFlow', 'OpenCV', 'Data Augmentation', 'Image Classification/Detection']}, {'title': 'Reinforcement Learning Agent for Simulation', 'description': 'Create a simulation environment (e.g., using Gym or custom environment) and train a Reinforcement Learning agent to solve a defined task. Focus on understanding state representation, reward functions, and policy optimization.', 'technologies': ['Python', 'Gym/PettingZoo', 'PyTorch', 'Reinforcement Learning']}], 'estimated_timeline': '6-9 Months', 'action_plan': ['Immediate: Master Python Data Science stack (Pandas, NumPy) and complete a foundational Machine Learning course.', 'Next 1 Month: Implement Scikit-learn models on existing web data to build practical experience.', 'Next 2-3 Months: Deep dive into PyTorch/TensorFlow and complete a full Deep Learning project (e.g., Image Classification).', 'Next 3-4 Months: Focus specifically on NLP, learn LangChain, and build a RAG application using Vector Databases.', 'Ongoing: Refactor existing projects to highlight data handling, model training, and MLOps practices instead of just web functionality.']}
