h practical experience building end-to-end applications, strong skills in Python, JavaScript frameworks (React.js), and database management. Demonstrated capability in deploying real-time systems using WebSockets/MQTT and integrating IoT concepts. Seeking to transition foundational development and AI project skills into a dedicated AI Engineering role.', 'strengths': ['Full Stack Development Proficiency', 'Backend API Development (Django/FastAPI)', 'Real-Time Communication Systems Knowledge (WebSockets, MQTT)', 'Cross-Platform UI/UX Design', 'DevOps and Deployment Experience'], 'missing_skills': [{'skill': 'Machine Learning Algorithms', 'priority': 'High', 'reason': 'Core requirement for an AI Engineer. Must demonstrate understanding of supervised, unsupervised learning, and model selection.'}, {'skill': 'Deep Learning Frameworks (PyTorch/TensorFlow)', 'priority': 'High', 'reason': 'Essential for modern AI development. Candidate needs exposure to building and training complex neural networks.'}, {'skill': 'Data Science Libraries (Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-learn)', 'priority': 'High', 'reason': 'Crucial for data manipulation, analysis, and feature engineering in an AI context.'}, {'skill': 'NLP/Computer Vision Techniques', 'priority': 'Medium', 'reason': 'While the project hints at AI, explicit knowledge in NLP (e.g., Transformers) or CV techniques is necessary for specialization.'}], 'suggestions': [{'title': 'Focus on ML/DL Project Depth', 'description': "Re-architect the 'AI Based Personal Companion' project to focus heavily on the machine learning component. Instead of just describing the interface, detail how data was collected, processed, features engineered, and the specific model (e.g., LLM fine-tuning, classification) used."}, {'title': 'Expand Technical Skill Stacks', 'description': 'Immediately add proficiency in Python Data Science libraries (Pandas, NumPy) and core ML frameworks (Scikit-learn, TensorFlow/PyTorch) to demonstrate readiness for an AI role.'}, {